# The fold-degree model's HBM page streams (foldsim_storage page_hbm_cost with
# an engines frame): an off-chip page word in columns of an AXI beat (512
# bits), each copy's share of engines its columns times the positions its
# page reads take of the frame (p x instances), the fold's engines at least
# its widest copy's columns and the shares' sum; against a controller per
# column of up to 4,096 bits; and a link stream riding the engines priced as
# its share of one (the positions its requests take of the frame).
# RUN: python3 %S/Inputs/paged/engines_price.py foldsim | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: p 4 frame 64: columns 2 share 2.000 engines lut {{[0-9]+}} lutram {{[0-9]+}}; per column 1 lut {{[0-9]+}} lutram {{[0-9]+}}
# CHECK: p 4 frame 256: columns 2 share 0.500
# CHECK: p 8 frame 128: columns 1 share 1.000
# CHECK: fold at 256: 5 engines, engine lut 1657 lutram 866
# CHECK: stream at 128: own ctl 1.0 lut {{[0-9]+}}; engines ctl 0.375 lut {{[0-9]+}}
# CHECK: built: engines 3 carried [('A', 'B')] controllers 1 lut {{[0-9]+}}
# CHECK: no forward: engine lut 1220 lutram 570; vmem 512 {{[0-9]+}}+{{[0-9]+}} -> {{[0-9]+}}+{{[0-9]+}}
